    "Cost": 2161185,
    "UIName": "Rifleman III",
    "Id": "chassisdef_rifleman_iii_RFL-III-C",
    "Name": "Rifleman III",
    "Details": "A clan prototype of an even more improved Rifleman III RF2-A, further improved by a group of Clan Coyote scientists that would eventually turn into the Society. The changes start already on the chassis level by using a Composite structure, mounting a 280 XXL engine and special recoil reducing arm actuators. To utilize the actuators fully the 'Mech mounts one LB-X AC/2 and one Rotary AC/10 in each arm. Further, it uses Stealth armor, a Nova CEWS and UAV to win any sensor war to be able to get close enough to obliterate its enemies. To aid the pilot, a VR cockpit with Enhance Imaging support, and a high-end Fire Control System.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.28</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
